<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 23.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 23.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire and Northamptonshire May 114.00/14.50 Jun 115.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk May 100.00 Jun 101.00 Oct/Dec 101.50</p>
<p>West Norfolk May 99.00/98.50/98.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire May 98.00/97.50</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire May 100.00 Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Hampshire May 98.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to West Norfolk May 95.50</p>
</text>
